WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.232 --> 00:00:02.950
- I'm thinking about going back to school.

00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.896
I don't know what job I'm gonna get.

00:00:04.896 --> 00:00:05.680
- Hm.

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:08.489
- Hey Carol, this party's kinda lame.

00:00:08.796 --> 00:00:11.861
I think I know just what it needs.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:15.856
(rock music)

00:00:15.856 --> 00:00:17.781
Stone Creek anyone?

00:00:22.554 --> 00:00:23.993
- Well, hello.

00:00:25.511 --> 00:00:29.352
(cheering)

00:00:31.338 --> 00:00:33.916
- [Woman] At Stone Creek,
our yogurt is made fresh,

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:35.721
straight from a cow's teat.

00:00:35.721 --> 00:00:39.437
The milk is then heated
to a smooth 176 degrees

00:00:39.437 --> 00:00:43.999
before adding the perfect blend
of lactobacillus bacteria,

00:00:43.999 --> 00:00:48.292
giving you the probiotic you
need to get your party going.

00:00:59.974 --> 00:01:02.539
- Sure, you can party without Stone Creek.

00:01:02.539 --> 00:01:04.366
But I wouldn't. (laughs)

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:11.470
- [Woman] Stone Creek.
Real American Yogurt.

00:01:12.229 --> 00:01:13.846
Consume dairy responsibly.

